* SingleStageOpamp -- provided op-amp macro for problems 16-22.
* (Translated from AnalogCoder subcircuit_lib/p11_lib.py.)
*
* Ports      : Vinp (non-inverting input), Vinn (inverting input), Vout
* Supply     : internal 5 V supply and 1.5 V tail bias (no supply pins)
* Operating  : DC operating voltage of Vinp/Vinn = 2.5 V; output range 0..5 V
*
* Usage:
*   .include opamp.lib
*   Xop  <non-inverting node> <inverting node> <output node>  SingleStageOpamp
*
.subckt SingleStageOpamp Vinp Vinn Vout
.model nmos_model nmos level=1 kp=100e-6 vto=0.5
.model pmos_model pmos level=1 kp=50e-6 vto=-0.5
Vdd   Vdd   0 5.0
Vbias Vbias 0 1.5
M1 Voutp Vinp  Source3 Source3 nmos_model W=50u  L=1u
M2 Vout  Vinn  Source3 Source3 nmos_model W=50u  L=1u
M3 Source3 Vbias 0     0       nmos_model W=100u L=1u
M4 Voutp Voutp Vdd     Vdd     pmos_model W=100u L=1u
M5 Vout  Voutp Vdd     Vdd     pmos_model W=100u L=1u
.ends SingleStageOpamp
